        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on winding mountain roads using a steering wheel controller and race against the clock!<br>Challenge past lap records and aim for the top of the leaderboard—can you beat the developer’s best time?<br>Choose from 4 cars and 2 courses, each available in both day and night settings.<br>Transmission options include automatic and manual. Compatible with 3-pedal + H-pattern shifter setups.*¹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through two courses inspired by real-world locations.<br>Master the unique handling characteristics of each of the four cars, and push for the fastest time on twisting, winding roads!<br>Compete against other players’ records and climb the local leaderboard.*²</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*¹ Confirmed to work only with the Thrustmaster T300RS. Functionality with other steering wheel controllers or gamepads is not guaranteed.<br>*² Leaderboard is local only. Online ranking not supported.</p>",
